%SIXMD 1
# @?CHOWN - CHANGE FILE OWNER

## @?OPERANDS

### @?UID
DECIMAL USER ID.

### @?GID
DECIMAL GROUP ID.

### @?PATH ...
ONE OR MORE FILESYSTEM OBJECTS TO CHANGE.

## DESCRIPTION

CHOWN SETS THE NUMERIC UID AND GID OF EACH PATH.  UID AND GID MUST FIT THE
CURRENT COMPACT OWNER FIELDS.
USAGE IS 'CHOWN UID GID PATH ...'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
